---
Make ADSR envelope visualization interactive (click-drag to adjust values).

The synth editor draws ADSR curves as read-only canvas graphics.
Make the control points draggable to adjust A/D/S/R values directly
on the graph instead of only via sliders.

## Design
- Draw handle dots at each phase boundary
- Horizontal drag on A handle: adjusts attack time
- Horizontal drag on D handle: adjusts decay time
- Vertical drag on S handle: adjusts sustain level
- Horizontal drag on R handle: adjusts release time
- Show value tooltip while dragging

## Acceptance Criteria
- [ ] Each ADSR point has a visible grab handle
- [ ] Dragging handles updates the corresponding parameter
- [ ] Sliders and graph stay in sync
- [ ] Works for both amp envelope and filter envelope

## Test Plan
- [ ] Drag attack handle, verify attack slider updates
- [ ] Drag sustain handle vertically, verify level changes
- [ ] Verify graph matches slider values after adjustment
